{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54472","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏与罚，须是要均平。\n不可狥（辛本作「循」）私行喜怒，稍（京本作「私」）偏亲旧失军情，如此（辛本、京本作「否则」）祸灾生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}